1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,986
A bamboo or a palm gets its width another way, by primary thickening.

2
00:00:04,986 --> 00:00:11,158
A meristem just below the shoot tip builds each segment at its full width before it elongates.

3
00:00:11,158 --> 00:00:13,502
Then the segment is simply pushed up.

4
00:00:13,502 --> 00:00:18,632
That is why a bamboo shoot comes out of the ground as wide as it will ever be.

